{%- comment -%}
============================================================================
Analytics Snippet — single source of truth for tracking codes
============================================================================
Generated by shopify-monitoring-and-daily-report skill.

USAGE
-----
1. Save this file as: snippets/analytics-snippet.liquid
2. Render once from layout/theme.liquid:
     <head>
       {%- render 'analytics-snippet' -%}
       {{ content_for_header }}
       ...
3. Fill in the IDs below. Empty string = that script is OFF.

WHY THIS PATTERN?
- One central place to add/remove any tracking code (Clarity / Pixel /
  TikTok / Hotjar / etc) without touching theme.liquid again.
- Each block is wrapped in `{% if id != '' %}` so a blank ID = silent disable.
- All scripts load `async` so they don't block the storefront.

⚠️ DO NOT put Customer Events tracking (purchase / add_to_cart) here. That
   belongs in Settings → Customer events as a Custom Pixel.
============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign clarity_id     = '' -%}
{%- assign fb_pixel_id    = '' -%}
{%- assign tiktok_pixel_id = '' -%}

{%- comment -%} Microsoft Clarity (heatmaps + session recordings) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if clarity_id != '' -%}
<script type="text/javascript">
  (function(c,l,a,r,i,t,y){
    c[a]=c[a]||function(){(c[a].q=c[a].q||[]).push(arguments)};
    t=l.createElement(r);t.async=1;t.src="https://www.clarity.ms/tag/"+i;
    y=l.getElementsByTagName(r)[0];y.parentNode.insertBefore(t,y);
  })(window, document, "clarity", "script", "{{ clarity_id }}");
</script>
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%} Meta (Facebook) Pixel — page-view base code only {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if fb_pixel_id != '' -%}
<script>
  !function(f,b,e,v,n,t,s){if(f.fbq)return;n=f.fbq=function(){n.callMethod?
  n.callMethod.apply(n,arguments):n.queue.push(arguments)};if(!f._fbq)f._fbq=n;
  n.push=n;n.loaded=!0;n.version='2.0';n.queue=[];t=b.createElement(e);t.async=!0;
  t.src=v;s=b.getElementsByTagName(e)[0];s.parentNode.insertBefore(t,s)}(window,
  document,'script','https://connect.facebook.net/en_US/fbevents.js');
  fbq('init', '{{ fb_pixel_id }}');
  fbq('track', 'PageView');
</script>
<noscript><img height="1" width="1" style="display:none"
  src="https://www.facebook.com/tr?id={{ fb_pixel_id }}&ev=PageView&noscript=1" alt=""/></noscript>
{%- endif -%}

